     "tooltipTitle": "Cruise Vacation Protection Plan",
     "tooltipBody": "Carnival Vacation Protection is available to US residents of all states except New York and Puerto Rico. It is also available to guests residing in U.S. Virgin Islands (St. Thomas, St. Croix, and St. John) and American Samoa - this includes citizens of the U.S, Permanent Residents and those living in the United States for 6 months of the year or longer (and have a valid U.S Government issued ID).<br />\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.carnival.com/about-carnival/vacation-protection.aspx\">More details.</a>",
